{"title":"Sunday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/930571802/0/marginalrevolution~Sunday-assorted-links.html","date":1764529207000,"content":"<p>1.<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/136Division/status/1994381171934064743\" target=\"_blank\"> False claims about China and Japan, but still worth pondering</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/object_zero_/status/1994562241299976222?s=46\" target=\"_blank\">False claims about birth rates and utility</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.ft.com/content/a7c2e587-a6cf-4a74-87b5-6838d188e9f1\" target=\"_blank\">Can management consultants be literary heroes?</a> (FT)</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/JesusFerna7026/status/1994464610922238065\" target=\"_blank\">JFV on equilibrium in economics</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/AndrasDobos81/status/1994841594600853949\" target=\"_blank\">When does low fertility shatter the social contract?</a></p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/centristmadness/status/1994818609227682024?s=46&amp;t=1KIISSI5-VN3zCDoAnzM-A\" target=\"_blank\">Naturally occurring furin cleavage sites</a>.</p>\r\n<p>7. If somehow you do not know the works of Tom Stoppard you should, RIP, here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2025/11/29/theater/tom-stoppard-dead.html\" target=\"_blank\">the NYT obituary</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/sunday-assorted-links-544.html\">Sunday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://mar